#: ../../docs/login/login-outer.rst:4 e8e776808eeb4595a9a180d1d10ddfe8
msgid "站外用户登录"
msgstr "External user login"

#: ../../docs/login/login-outer.rst:7 785f517f8b954b31b27bef527bdac0ba
msgid "对于非台站内网用户，登录 cnSRC 前需要先完成外网访问开通。"
msgstr ""
"For users outside the SHAO intranet, external access must be enabled before "
"logging in to cnSRC."

#: ../../docs/login/login-outer.rst:9 24768d8aa8c24c599294c3c677355b45
msgid ""
"站外接入流程参考 SRCNet 平台常见方式，通常包含 VPN 或固定出口 IP 白名单两类方"
"案。"
msgstr ""
"External access follows common SRCNet-style methods, usually including VPN "
"access or fixed egress-IP whitelisting."

#: ../../docs/login/login-outer.rst:11 215a328a06744ce18724d4666302fd42
msgid "开通完成后，请按 :ref:`login-inter` 完成统一认证登录和 SSH 登录。"
msgstr ""
"After access is enabled, follow :ref:`login-inter` for unified "
"authentication login and SSH login."

#: ../../docs/login/login-outer.rst:13 32ee1c0492924e108b2b171711f594f7
msgid "新用户申请请参考 :ref:`user-register` 章节。"
msgstr "For new user applications, please refer to :ref:`user-register`."

#: ../../docs/login/login-outer.rst:15 5aae52827820432f9d13d0019e1d8269
msgid "如需协助，请联系 cnsrc@shao.ac.cn。"
msgstr "For assistance, contact cnsrc@shao.ac.cn."
